    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, why would his race or what he's wearing make him more reliable in court? Isn't the jury supposed to look at the facts of what they saw? Seems like you're saying a guy in a suit is just naturally more trustworthy than a kid in a hoodie regardless of the actual info they give.",
